body:grpc {
  name: message 1
  content: '''
    {
      "owner_address": "QeVS9kh1hcK1i8LJu0SSvB8XEyzQ",
      "resource": "ENERGY",
      "balance": 1000000,
      "receiver_address": "QdC2ljFEDwpJS7Uffu5o/1xZPADw"
    }
  '''
}

docs {
  Builds an **unsigned** transaction that delegates staked bandwidth or energy
  to another account. Sign locally and submit via `BroadcastTransaction`.

  - `balance`: amount of staked TRX (in SUN) backing the delegation.

  **Service:** `protocol.Wallet` · **Method:** `DelegateResource` (unary)

  All `bytes` fields are sent as **base64 of the raw bytes** (protobuf JSON mapping).
  For a TRON address, base58-decode it (or take the 21-byte hex form starting with `41`)
  and base64-encode the raw bytes, e.g. `echo 41E552...32CD0 | xxd -r -p | base64`.
}
